          "startDate": "2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z",
          "description": "As a platform administrator, I want to manage a persistent competition and season catalog, so that leagues and cups can be configured without redeploying the platform.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n1  When a valid competition and season are added, persist their relationship, provider identifiers and Arabic and English names without hardcoded identifiers.\n2  Reject a second record with the same Provider and ExternalSeasonId. Reject invalid dates and references to nonexistent competitions.\n3  When a competition is outside the provider account's coverage, retain it as Draft with a clear reason and do not publish it to users.\n4  When a season is enabled or disabled, audit before-and-after values, actor and timestamp, and update the configuration version without restarting the service.\n\nRequired Changes  Add Competition and CompetitionSeason entities, repositories, DTOs and permissions. Convert appsettings into repeatable initial seeding that does not overwrite administrative settings.\n\nDependencies  None; this story establishes the foundation for the other stories.",
